- Acute rheumatic fever age 13, on long-term penicillin until 21, stopped per cardiology. Last echo ~2 yrs ago reportedly normal (no report in file).  
- PID (chlamydia) last year, treated, no current pelvic/urinary sx.  
No regular meds. NKDA. Non-smoker.  

Obs 09:20  
T 38.5 (oral)  
HR 102 reg  
BP 108/68  
RR 16  
SpO₂ 99% RA  

